.com/users/rheaditi","html_url":"https://github.com/rheaditi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rheaditi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T10:02:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T10:02:53Z","body":"Facing this issue too; seems like this was raised before but closed https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/1230\n\nIt definitely is something related to Copilot because disabling the extension allows saving as normal, with the same settings as before.\n\nFor me, workspace settings has:\n```json\n\"editor.codeActionsOnSave\": {\n    \"source.fixAll\": \"explicit\"\n},\n\"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n```\n\nUser settings has:\n```json\n\"editor.codeActionsOnSave\": {\n  \"source.fixAll\": \"never\",\n  \"source.organizeImports\": \"never\"\n},\n\"editor.formatOnSave\": false,\n\"github.copilot.editor.enableCodeActions\": false\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2568974882/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2815194041","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/1378#issuecomment-2815194041",